ion>\n<div class=\"wf-workspace-bar\" data-wf-bar=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n<div class=\"wf-query-summary\"><span class=\"wf-query-label\">Current search</span><code data-wf-applied=\"\" title=\"\"></code><span class=\"wf-draft-badge\" data-wf-dirty=\"\" hidden=\"\">Draft changed</span></div>\n<div class=\"wf-view-actions\"><button aria-controls=\"wf-query-editor\" data-wf-edit=\"\" type=\"button\" hidden=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\">Edit query</button><button aria-controls=\"search-results\" data-wf-results=\"\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Results <span data-wf-count=\"\">(0)</span></button></div>\n</div>\n<section aria-label=\"Build an advanced query\" class=\"search-hero\" data-fb-search-mode=\"advanced\" id=\"wf-query-editor\" style=\"--mk-finder-fg-strong: rgba(15,23,42,.95); --mk-finder-fg: rgba(15,23,42,.84); --mk-finder-fg-muted: rgba(15,23,42,.63); --mk-finder-fg-disabled: rgba(15,23,42,.46); --mk-finder-text: rgba(15,23,42,.84); --wf-fg: rgba(15,23,42,.95); --wf-muted: rgba(15,23,42,.63);\">\n<div class=\"wf-editor-heading\"><h2>Build an advanced query</h2><a href=\"about.html#course-codes\">Course codes ↗</a></div>\n<p class=\"wf-editor-help\">Add keywords or course tags, then combine them below.</p>\n<div class=\"fb-search-modes\"><form aria-label=\"Find a concept\" id=\"fb-simple-search\" role=\"search\" data-fb-bound=\"1\" hidden=\"\">\n<label for=\"fb-simple-input\">Concept, course or lecture</label>\n<div class=\"fb-simple-search__row\"><input autocomplete=\"off\" id=\"fb-simple-input\" maxlength=\"500\" placeholder=\"e.g. chain rule, m1c\" type=\"search\"><button type=\"submit\">Search</button></div>\n<p aria-live=\"polite\" id=\"fb-simple-status\" role=\"status\">Type a topic and press Enter.</p>\n</form><button aria-controls=\"search-form find-builder\" aria-expanded=\"true\" id=\"fb-search-mode\" type=\"button\">← Simple search</button><p id=\"fb-advanced-draft-note\">Advanced query keeps its own draft and undo history. Your simple search results remain available; run an advanced query to replace them.</p></div>\n<form class=\"search-hero__form fb-find-form\" id=\"search-form\" data-fb-enter-submit-bound-v1=\"1\" data-fb-add-split-v1=\"1\">\n<div class=\"fb-addtoken-bar\"><div class=\"fb-tokensearch-wrap\" style=\"--fb-token-input-h: 44px;\" data-fb-token-assist-pointer-guard=\"1\"><input aria-label=\"Search concepts\" autocomplete=\"off\" class=\"search-hero__input\" id=\"search-input\" placeholder=\"limit, m1c, m2la\" type=\"search\" aria-describedby=\"mk-search-field-hint-2\" data-fb-token-assist-bound=\"1\" style=\"--mk-finder-fg-strong: rgba(15,23,42,.95); --mk-finder-fg: rgba(15,23,42,.84); --mk-finder-fg-muted: rgba(15,23,42,.63); --mk-finder-fg-disabled: rgba(15,23,42,.46); --mk-finder-text: rgba(15,23,42,.84); --wf-fg: rgba(15,23,42,.95); --wf-muted: rgba(15,23,42,.63); scroll-margin-top: 72px; scroll-margin-bottom: min(48vh, 380px);\"><div class=\"fb-tokensearch-overlay\" style=\"letter-spacing: normal; padding: 0px 14px; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; line-height: 16px;\"><span class=\"fb-tokensearch-mirror\"></span><span class=\"fb-tokensearch-suffix\" style=\"display: none;\"></span></div><div class=\"fb-tokensearch-dropdown\" role=\"listbox\" style=\"display: none; --mk-finder-fg-strong: rgba(15,23,42,.95); --mk-finder-fg: rgba(15,23,42,.84); --mk-finder-fg-muted: rgba(15,23,42,.63); --mk-finder-fg-disabled: rgba(15,23,42,.46); --mk-finder-text: rgba(15,23,42,.84); --wf-fg: rgba(15,23,42,.95); --wf-muted: rgba(15,23,42,.63);\" data-fb-scroll-guard=\"1\"></div></div><div class=\"fb-addtoken-actions\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"add-token-pool\" class=\"search-hero__button fb-cta-btn\" data-fb-cta-decorated=\"1\" style=\"text-decoration: none; box-shadow: none; outline: none; --mk-finder-fg-strong: rgba(15,23,42,.95); --mk-finder-fg: rgba(15,23,42,.84); --mk-finder-fg-muted: rgba(15,23,42,.63); --mk-finder-fg-disabled: rgba(15,23,42,.46); --mk-finder-text: rgba(15,23,42,.84); --wf-